        1802,
        1631
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I have designated Victor F. Condello, Assistant to the Mayor, to be the City's Legislative Representative in Albany. During the course of the legislative session, Mr. Condello will refer pending bills to appropriate City Departments and agencies for their detailed analysis and recommendations in accordance with the following standard procedure.",
