      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Reports on pending State legislation should be made on the prescribed City forms. Form NYC 55 will be used for reporting recommended approvals. Form NYC 56 will be used for reporting recommended disapprovals. Supplies of these forms may be obtained on requisition to the Chief Clerk of this office.",
